    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "rect_427fb5321fcf2ce6",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 283,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 6778,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "text_427fb5321fcf2ce6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1720000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text_427fb5321fcf2ce6",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 825,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 273,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "baseFontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "fontWeight": 400,
      "text": "1. Uses seperate backbones to extract multi-level features from RT(Range-Time) radar maps and images.\n2. No heavy processing of Radar data; so has access to relatively dense radar cloud\n3. Cross attention -\n\t1. \u201cThis azimuth corresponds to exactly one image column.\u201d\n\t2. \u201cThis range corresponds to a specific row in the RT map.\u201d",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": "rect_427fb5321fcf2ce6",
      "originalText": "1. Uses seperate backbones to extract multi-level features from RT(Range-Time) radar maps and images.\n2. No heavy processing of Radar data; so has access to relatively dense radar cloud\n3. Cross attention -\n\t1. \u201cThis azimuth corresponds to exactly one image column.\u201d\n\t2. \u201cThis range corresponds to a specific row in the RT map.\u201d",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 6779,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1720000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "rect_38f84d7c7807a473",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 348,
      "height": 201,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
