    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text_38f84d7c7807a473",
      "x": 405,
      "y": 825,
      "width": 338,
      "height": 191,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "baseFontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "fontWeight": 400,
      "text": "NOTES:\n1. The main disadvantage of camera only modality is lack of depth info",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": "rect_38f84d7c7807a473",
      "originalText": "NOTES:\n1. The main disadvantage of camera only modality is lack of depth info",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 2675,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1720000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "rect_5f55217fc997de6c",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 161,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 4779,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "text_5f55217fc997de6c",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1720000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text_5f55217fc997de6c",
      "x": 705,
      "y": 825,
      "width": 290,
      "height": 151,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "baseFontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "fontWeight": 400,
      "text": "1. Camera still needs more work especially during adverse weather.\n2. Camera feature map is not well integrated with the rest",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": "rect_5f55217fc997de6c",
      "originalText": "1. Camera still needs more work especially during adverse weather.\n2. Camera feature map is not well integrated with the rest",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 4780,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1720000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "rect_6b07d3a2cdb74873",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 289,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 903,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "text_6b07d3a2cdb74873",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1720000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text_6b07d3a2cdb74873",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 945,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 279,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "baseFontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "fontWeight": 400,
      "text": "1. Using established methods for sensor-specific encoders and detection head for extracting BEV feature maps\n2. Main novelty is that for each patch the best sensor is given weightage and using a weighted average of all three sensors the unified bev map is generated\n3. ASF dynamically adapts to different sensor combinations without retraining",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": "rect_6b07d3a2cdb74873",
      "originalText": "1. Using established methods for sensor-specific encoders and detection head for extracting BEV feature maps\n2. Main novelty is that for each patch the best sensor is given weightage and using a weighted average of all three sensors the unified bev map is generated\n3. ASF dynamically adapts to different sensor combinations without retraining",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 904,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1720000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
