      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "baseFontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "fontWeight": 400,
      "text": "1. Performs better for long range detection than short range detection due to liberal annotations in long range\n2. Imperfect Z localization - blaming LiDAR annotation",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": "rect_2d0a7b3c08170a41",
      "originalText": "1. Performs better for long range detection than short range detection due to liberal annotations in long range\n2. Imperfect Z localization - blaming LiDAR annotation",
